<view class="screen"><view class="heading">成就钱包</view><view class="subtitle">每次挑战成功后计入的模拟节省金额。</view><view wx:if="{{status === 'error'}}" class="error-box" bindtap="retry">明细加载失败 · 重试</view><view class="section"><view wx:if="{{!items.length}}" class="empty">{{status === 'loading' ? '正在整理明细…' : '还没有成功记录，新的开始也很好。'}}</view><view class="list-item row" wx:for="{{items}}" wx:key="_id"><view><view>{{item.merchantName}}</view><view class="muted">{{item.time}}</view></view><text class="link">+ ¥{{item.amount}}</text></view></view><button wx:if="{{hasMore}}" class="soft-button" bindtap="more">查看更多</button><button class="action stack" bindtap="withdraw">去提现</button><view class="muted stack">这里记录的是模拟成果。提现功能暂未开放。</view></view>

